# Input
```astro
<!-- should generate diagnostics -->
<style define:vars={{ used, unused }}>
    p { color: var(--used); }
</style>

<style define:vars={{ emptyStyle }}></style>

<style define:vars={{ firstOnly }}>
    p { color: black; }
</style>

<style define:vars={{ secondUsed }}>
    p {
        color: var(--firstOnly);
        background: var(--secondUsed);
    }
</style>

<style define:vars={{ color }}>
    p { color: var(--color-primary); }
</style>

<style define:vars={{ color }}>
    p { color: var(--theme--color); }
</style>

```

